.TH EXPORT_FROM_CHUNKS 1 2024-Nov "" "make batch export of the images on the disk"
.SH NAME
export_from_chunks \- export_from_chunks(wavFile, output.dir, size = 364, lines = 512, smooth = 2, report = FALSE)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIexport_from_chunks(wavFile, output.dir, size = 364, lines = 512, smooth = 2, report = FALSE)\fR
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBwavFile\fB \fR\- . the file path to the disk image in wave file
.PP
.PP
\fBoutput.dir\fB \fR\- . the directory path for export the image files
.PP
.PP
\fBsize\fB \fR\- 364. the pixel cells (the image rows) inside a single scan line
.PP
.PP
\fBlines\fB \fR\- 512. the number of the scan lines (the image columns)
.PP
.PP
\fBsmooth\fB \fR\- 2. the radius of the across scan line smoothing
.PP
.PP
\fBreport\fB \fR\- FALSE. print the empirical analysis report of every image section
.PP
.SH FILES
.PP
SMRUCC/R#.declare_function.export_from_chunks at chunks.R:line 24
.PP
